sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Officer
    participant W as Angular
    participant A as API
    participant R as RuleSet
    participant P as Provider
    participant D as Oracle (app_ai)

    O->>W: opens claim 1001
    W->>A: POST /api/ai/claims/1001/triage
    A->>D: select from v_claim_context
    D-->>A: amount, age, history (no PII)

    A->>R: evaluate
    alt a rule matches
        R-->>A: suggestion, no cost
    else no rule matches
        A->>P: prompt + payload
        P-->>A: JSON
        A->>A: parse, clamp, apply limit guard
    end

    A->>D: insert ai_suggestions
    A->>D: insert audit_trail
    A->>D: pr_flag_for_review (row lock) when needed
    A-->>W: suggestion
    W-->>O: shown with risk band

    O->>W: accept or override
    W->>A: POST /feedback
    A->>D: insert claim_decisions (decided_by from gateway header)
